pan> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal\">../batch05/58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}\\bigl(J,\\mathcal P(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\nA\\notin J.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}\\bigl(J,\\mathcal P(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\nA\\notin J.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate now states the regular-cardinal carrier condition and the full proper-ideal axioms through the upstream ideal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark",